   Cadena-Nogales, Pedro Daniel, Univ Reg Amazon IKIAM, Fac Ciencias Socioambientales, Phys Dept, Parroquia Muyuna Km 7, Napo 150102, Ecuador.
   Verdugo-Perona, Jose Javier; Solaz-Portoles, Joan Josep; Sanjose, Vicente, Univ Valencia, Fac Teaching Training, Dept Expt \& Social Sci Educ, CDC Res Grp, Avda Tarongers 4, Valencia 46022, Spain.},
DOI = {10.3390/su17093860},
Article-Number = {3860},
EISSN = {2071-1050},
Keywords = {socioscientific issues; education for sustainability; preservice science
